  end
  RUNJOBCMD --> RUNJOBSUP
  CLIMAIN --> TRAYCMD
  CLIMAIN --> WEBAPPCMD
  CLIMAIN --> HOSTCMD
  CLIMAIN --> SCANCMD
  CLIMAIN --> RUNJOBCMD

