quality presets + per-stage times for the readout (#1721)"]
    DESKIN["desktop/input.py\nScreen control: 0-1 to virtual-desktop mapping,\nthe one SendInput seam, held input released on close (#1521)"]
    DESKCLIP["desktop/clipboard.py
Screen clipboard: the one clipboard seam, text to the PC only,
